    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυχθ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύζω</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make a
				noise by closing the mouth and forcing the breath through the
				nostrils, snort</i>, esp. from passion, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				461
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make mouths, sneer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείλεσι μυχθίζοισα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					20.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιμὰ σεσηρὼς μυχθίζεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.178
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. καὶ διαψιθυρίζω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					15.26.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
